--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -60,3 +60,42 @@ Marks all unread notifications as read.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Returns the notification settings of the current user.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+}
+```
+
+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the current user's notification settings.
+
+Notifications are emailed in bundles: the first notification that lands opens a time window, and everything
+that arrives before the window closes is sent in a single email. The `bundle_email_frequency` sets how long
+that window stays open:
+
+| Value | Meaning |
+| --- | --- |
+| `never` | No notification emails |
+| `every_few_hours` | One email every four hours |
+| `daily` | One email a day |
+| `weekly` | One email a week |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
